{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">脫口秀近年在內地爆紅，引起廣東人反追棟篤笑熱潮，廣州有一班年輕人，遊走灣區九市開個人專場，將廣府棟篤笑帶入百姓家，傳承粵語和這門笑匠藝術。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">主持：黎慧怡</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">雞翅說：「有的朋友件衫餿到，我是想叫他『三叔公』。人在廣東，吾日三洗吾身啊。」</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">雞翅又說：「上學的時候，同學就會給你起難聽的外號，我擠痘時管我叫『豌豆射手』。」</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">專場主持人</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">Chris</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">：「今晚的主角－－雞翅。」</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"8.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026IohtScVxgu1790146360.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"8.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">他叫雞翅，亦可以叫他雞翼，他是廣州一名棟篤笑演員。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"> </span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"6.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026MJV8ByYlB51790146338.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"6.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">返工、搭車，所有生活小事都可以是題材。跟很多廣東八、九十後一樣，雞翅自小喜歡香港文化，尤其欣賞黃子華。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"> </span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"9.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026Sc2HJ5661b1790146374.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">雞翅回憶：「我印象最深刻的，當然是『搵食啫，犯法啊？』。」</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">主持問：「為何？」</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">雞翅回答：「我覺得很適合現代人的生活狀態，搞笑之餘要有些表達，要有些特別思考在內。」</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"11.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026Z1ZDtgZYTI1790146393.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"11.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">全職做棟篤笑</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">6</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">年，他去過上海打拼，最後都是返來粵語大本營，在這類商場舖位開專場。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">雞翅稱：「這間採耳按摩旁，就是我們的野生劇場，入到來就見到好多這些『閒雜人士』。」</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"10.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026zTuy5vCxPM1790146383.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"10.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">同幾個拍檔，包辦劇場大小事。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">雞翅問：「慧怡，現在我們之間的距離是否很近？」</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">主持回應：「真的很近。」</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">雞翅表示：「是呀，我的棟篤笑和觀眾之間的距離，就是非常近，我們倆現在是否可以走心？」</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">主持直言：「但你也不用跪下。」</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">雞翅就說：「不好意思。」</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"12.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20261oNdTcZfrF1790146403.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"12.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">這個容納</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">300</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">人的小天地，成為他的大舞台。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">雞翅認為：「在現在這個社會人和人之間的關係，日趨於冷漠的情況下，還可以有一種藝術，將人與人之間的關係重新黏在一起。」</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"2.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20267I2ZZhJ2n01790146285.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">不怕「無厘頭」，最怕不好笑要「露宿街頭」，目前每星期開一、兩場，位位百五元</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">人民幣</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif;\">)</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">，都經常爆滿。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"5.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026j45rbUqBgX1790146316.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"5.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">雞翅表示：「世俗些說的話是可以『搵到錢』。我更加想再劃一劃我們大陸廣東，內地的文化，會否都產生一些有意思的東西呢，你其實是將快樂傳播給觀眾，都幾有意思，幾有意義這件事。」</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"7.JPG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20269rdDFMK69L1790146348.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"7.JPG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-27T01:38:41.864993+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":776,"images":9,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}